      "summaries": {
        "en": "FlClash is a multi-platform proxy client built on ClashMeta, designed to simplify secure network access across devices. Its core strength lies in combining the powerful ClashMeta engine with a clean Flutter UI, supporting protocols like V2Ray, Hysteria, and VLESS. Technically, it offers seamless configuration management and real-time traffic monitoring. You can use it as a daily VPN alternative, deploy it on mobile or desktop, or extend it with custom rules for advanced routing.",
        "zh": "FlClash 是一款基于 ClashMeta 的多平台代理客户端，旨在简化跨设备的网络安全访问。它通过 Flutter 构建了简洁直观的用户界面，同时集成了 ClashMeta 强大的代理引擎，支持 V2Ray、Hysteria、VLESS 等多种协议。其技术亮点在于配置管理的便捷性和实时流量监控功能，让用户无需复杂操作即可实现高效代理。你可以将其作为日常 VPN 替代方案，在手机、电脑上使用，或通过自定义规则实现精细化流量路由，适合需要稳定、灵活代理的个人用户和开发者。",
        "es": "FlClash is a multi-platform proxy client built on ClashMeta, designed to simplify secure network access across devices. Its core strength lies in combining the powerful ClashMeta engine with a clean Flutter UI, supporting protocols like V2Ray, Hysteria, and VLESS. Technically, it offers seamless configuration management and real-time traffic monitoring. You can use it as a daily VPN alternative, deploy it on mobile or desktop, or extend it with custom rules for advanced routing.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "FlClash stands out for clash, clash-meta, and flutter in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "FlClash is a multi-platform proxy client built on ClashMeta, designed to simplify secure network access across devices. Its core strength lies in combining the powerful ClashMeta engine with a clean Flutter UI, supporting protocols like V2Ray, Hysteria, and VLESS. Technically, it offers seamless configuration management and real-time traffic monitoring. You can use it as a daily VPN alternative, deploy it on mobile or desktop, or extend it with custom rules for advanced routing.",
