      "summaries": {
        "en": "Social-auto-upload is an open-source Python tool that automates video uploading to multiple social media platforms like TikTok, YouTube, and Bilibili, solving the repetitive task of manual cross-posting. Its core strength lies in simulating browser interactions via Selenium, handling platform-specific upload quirks without official APIs. You can integrate it into content pipelines by configuring platform credentials and video metadata, then running scheduled uploads to maintain a consistent multi-platform presence.",
        "zh": "Social-auto-upload 是一个开源 Python 工具，专为自动化视频上传至抖音、小红书、视频号、YouTube、Bilibili 等平台设计，解决跨平台分发时重复手动操作的痛点。其核心技术通过 Selenium 模拟浏览器操作，绕过各平台上传限制与界面差异，无需官方 API 即可稳定上传。用户可配置账号信息与视频元数据，设定定时任务，实现自动分发至多平台，保持更新频率。该工具显著节省时间，适合需同时运营多个社交媒体账号的创作者或团队。",
        "es": "Social-auto-upload is an open-source Python tool that automates video uploading to multiple social media platforms like TikTok, YouTube, and Bilibili, solving the repetitive task of manual cross-posting. Its core strength lies in simulating browser interactions via Selenium, handling platform-specific upload quirks without official APIs. You can integrate it into content pipelines by configuring platform credentials and video metadata, then running scheduled uploads to maintain a consistent multi-platform presence.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "social-auto-upload stands out for bilibili, douyin, and tiktok in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Social-auto-upload is an open-source Python tool that automates video uploading to multiple social media platforms like TikTok, YouTube, and Bilibili, solving the repetitive task of manual cross-posting. Its core strength lies in simulating browser interactions via Selenium, handling platform-specific upload quirks without official APIs. You can integrate it into content pipelines by configuring platform credentials and video metadata, then running scheduled uploads to maintain a consistent multi-platform presence.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/dreammis/social-auto-upload for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
